// Texas Grade 7 social studies: Texas history (TEKS 19 TAC §113.19), by the eras the TEKS list, with Texas geography,
// economics, government and citizenship. Every unit is written for Texas. American Indian groups are described as the
// TEKS do (Gulf, Plains, Puebloan, Southeastern); nations living today are in the present tense, and nothing sacred or
// ceremonial is included. The missions, slavery, the Texas Revolution, secession, Reconstruction, segregation and the
// civil rights movements are told factually and neutrally.

